    "title": "Teen reported missing out of Galway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Courtney Ward ,\n2 hours ago\nGALWAY, N.Y. ( NEWS10 ) — Police are looking for a teenager reported missing out of the town of Galway. Hailey Ann Heigel was last seen around 5 p.m. Wednesday walking on Galway Road.\nGet the latest news, weather, sports and entertainment delivered right to your inbox! Hailey is 16 years old. She is described as being around 5’1″ and 103 lbs. She has brown hair and brown eyes and was last seen wearing a black sweatshirt, black leggings and gray boots.\nPolice said she may be in need of medical attention.\nAnyone who sees her should call 911 or the Saratoga County Sheriff’s Office at (518) 885-5522.\nRead the latest from NEWS10:\nNEWS10 is the Capital Region’s local news leader!\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to NEWS10 ABC.",
